# Merge When Ready

Finished agent work is not complete at push.  Default landing path:

1. Commit and push on the feature branch.
2. Open or update the pull request (draft only when the owner or lane explicitly requires it).
3. Enable GitHub **auto-merge** (squash unless the repo lane documents another method).
4. Fix failing required checks and resolve blocking review threads until CI is green.
5. Let auto-merge complete, or merge explicitly once green if auto-merge is unavailable.

Do not merge with red required checks.  Do not force-push unless the owner asks.  Pause only for force-push, prod data wipe, or live-key revoke.
